  "title": "SMB2: initialize 'disconnected in frame' to 0",
  "description": "When creating a new `smb2_tid_info_t` struct, explicitly set its\n`disconnect_frame` member to 0. Prevents potential misleading\ninformation (and uninitialized memory access) if the value ever gets\nexamined without having been set.\n\nCloses #20083",
